mapping "VEI.1" source="VEI" target="d570" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source VEI = behaviors and habits regarding
 medication use. ICF has NO dedicated medication-adherence concept; the closest standard concept
 is d570 (Looking after one's health), the
 self-care/health-maintenance parent that legitimately subsumes medication adherence (no clinical
 meaning of medication-use behavior falls outside self-health management). Target subsumes source
 => broader. Confidence low: the subsumption is real but loose (medication adherence is one slice
 of d570; one-level broader with no dedicated target and no crosswalk). d570 verified present in
 ICF mirror.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
