mapping "VEN.1" source="VEN" target="d7203" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source VEN = norm-breaking behaviors (conduct/rule-breaking). ICF has
 no conduct-disorder concept; the closest standard concept is d7203 (Interacting according to social rules), the d720
 complex-interaction child whose inverse domain norm-breaking behavior violates. Source is the
 inverse/associated domain of d7203 (a behavior ABOUT/against social-rule-following); related
 link, weak, not broader/narrower (norm-breaking is not subsumed by rule-following; it is its
 violation). d7203 verified present in ICF mirror.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
