mapping "VEO.1" source="VEO" target="d570" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source VEO = risk-taking behaviors (a KSI behavioral/social-service
 domain code covering self-endangering/reckless conduct). ICF has no risk-taking-behavior
 concept; the closest standard concept is d570 (Looking after one's
 own health), the d5 self-care concept whose domain risk-taking behavior inverts/violates
 (reckless and self-endangering conduct is precisely the failure to look after one's own health).
 Source is the inverse/associated domain of d570 (a behavior-domain framing of the area d570
 represents as a self-care activity), so related rather than exact_match or broader per the
 about/concept-axis-mismatch pattern established for sibling KSI domain parents (VEC/VED in
 proposal-0007, VEE/VEN in proposal-0008, VEP in proposal-0010); weak, not broader/narrower
 (risk-taking is not subsumed by health self-care; it is its violation). d570 verified present in
 source/function/ICF/concepts.tdl. Note: b1304 Impulskontroll is a body-function (b-code), not an
 activity/participation code, and does not match the KSI behavioral-domain axis; d570 is the
 canonical d-level inverse.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
